WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for the Free Calorie Counter mission video

1
00:00.600 --> 00:03.020
Most calorie apps want two things from you.

2
00:03.400 --> 00:05.193
Your money. And your data.

3
00:05.700 --> 00:07.841
Free Calorie Counter wants neither.

4
00:08.000 --> 00:12.183
It's completely free. No subscription, no ads, no account.

5
00:12.400 --> 00:16.792
And nothing you log ever leaves your phone. There's no server to send it to.

6
00:17.000 --> 00:21.900
Log your weight and every meal in seconds. Food by food, or just the total.

7
00:25.100 --> 00:27.269
Watch your goal ring fill through the day.

8
00:28.400 --> 00:30.584
See your trends in calories and weight.

9
00:33.400 --> 00:35.992
And compare today with your own averages.

10
00:36.400 --> 00:40.527
Keep progress photos, side by side. They stay on your phone too.

11
00:41.000 --> 00:44.701
Your data is yours. Back it up to a file whenever you like.

12
00:45.400 --> 00:49.350
We made this free, and public, because it's the right thing to do.

13
00:49.800 --> 00:51.555
Health shouldn't cost people.

14
00:53.600 --> 00:58.478
Free Calorie Counter. Open the link, add it to your Home Screen, and start today.
